				<title>SCP-1470</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1470</link>
				<description>

&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:220px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-1470/220px-Portia.fimbriata.male.-.tanikawa.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:220px;&quot; alt=&quot;220px-Portia.fimbriata.male.-.tanikawa.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
